[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0878","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0878.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0726","title":"Stalkerlab Mailers CGIMail 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Stalkerlab Mailers 1.1.2 中的 CGIMail.exe CGI 程序存在任意文件读取漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 $Attach$ 隐藏表单变量中指定目标文件路径，利用该 CGI 程序的文件读取功能获取服务器上的任意文件内容，如配置文件、密码文件等敏感信息。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，影响运行 Stalkerlab Mailers 1.1.2 的 Web 服务器，CVSS 评分 2.6，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0726"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:21.180","remediation":"建议立即删除或禁用 Stalkerlab Mailers 1.1.2 中的 CGIMail.exe 文件；如业务需要保留该功能，升级到已修复此漏洞的最新版本（若厂商已停止维护则迁移至其他受支持的邮件网关产品），同时在 Web 服务器层面对该 CGI 程序添加 IP 白名单访问控制，并严格过滤 $Attach$ 参数中的路径遍历字符（如 ../）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1623","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=20000829194618.H7744%40thathost.com","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5165","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0726.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0726","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0726.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0726.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/cgimail.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0726.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/snort/drop-rules/web-cgi.rules","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/cgimail.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0878.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0878.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0878.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0877","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0877.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0725","title":"Zope Zope getRoles 权限管理漏洞","description":"Zope 2.2.1 之前版本存在权限控制不当漏洞，由于对 getRoles 方法的访问限制不严格，能够编辑 DTML 的用户可通过修改请求中包含的角色列表来添加或修改系统角色。攻击者利用此漏洞可提升权限，执行未授权操作，影响系统安全性。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0725"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:21.033","remediation":"立即升级 Zope 至 2.2.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 getRoles 方法的权限检查缺陷。如无法升级，严格限制可编辑 DTML 模板的用户权限，仅授予受信任管理员 DTML 编辑权，并定期审计角色列表变更日志。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0198.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0259.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20000821","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-052.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1577","http://www.zope.org/Products/Zope/Hotfix_08_09_2000/security_alert","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86060d5336eceede57f01ccb65fb3037638af8db/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0725.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0725","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/zope/CVE-2000-0725.yml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0725.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/GHSA/data/2000/CVE-2000-0725.json","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/aad1d5d7fcfd4bf7bee792090d157de726946a96/vulns/zope/PYSEC-2026-757.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/github-reviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9cmq-pj6p-hgwf/GHSA-9cmq-pj6p-hgwf.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0725.yaml","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0877.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0876","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0876.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0724","title":"Helix GNOME go-gnome Pre-installer 符号链接攻击任意文件写入漏洞","description":"go-gnome Helix GNOME 预安装器存在任意文件写入漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在 /tmp 目录下对 uudecode、snarf 及部分安装程序文件实施符号链接攻击，诱使预安装器以提升的权限覆写系统任意文件，导致权限提升或系统文件破坏。该漏洞影响使用 go-gnome 预安装器的 GNOME 环境，CVSS 评分 6.2，危害等级中危。建议用户升级至修复版本或手动加固 /tmp 目录权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0724"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:20.903","remediation":"删除 go-gnome 软件包（该软件已多年无人维护），改用系统自带包管理器（如 apt/yum）安装 GNOME。如需保留使用，必须修改源码将 /tmp 下所有临时文件（uudecode、snarf 等）改用 mkstemp 创建随机文件名，并在创建前取消设置危险 umask 值。临时缓解措施：以非特权用户运行安装程序，避免 root 提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0351.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0356.htm