2:20.770","remediation":"升级 helix-update 至 0.5 以上版本。如无法升级，手动设置 /tmp 目录的 sticky bit（chmod +t /tmp），并确保系统关键配置文件（如 /etc/config.d/bashrc）的拥有者为 root 且权限为 644。同时避免在共享环境下使用 helix-update 的默认安装方式。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0251.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1596","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=E13QAYl-0007il-00%40the-village.bc.nu","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0723.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0723","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0723.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0723.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xfvx-h8x3-2vxx/GHSA-xfvx-h8x3-2vxx.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1596/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0723.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f4aeb36d-9e29-43c9-8186-c062d85bdb06.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--f4aeb36d-9e29-43c9-8186-c062d85bdb06.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0875.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0874","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0874.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0722","title":"Helix Gnome Updater helix-update 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Helix GNOME Updater (helix-update) 0.5 及更早版本中存在条件竞争漏洞，本地普通用户可通过在 root 用户执行软件包安装操作前，预先创建 /tmp/helix-install 临时目录并放入恶意 RPM 软件包，利用该目录的权限继承机制诱导 helix-update 以 root 权限安装恶意包，从而实现任意 RPM 包的安装与提权。该漏洞影响 GNOME 桌面环境下使用 helix-update 的系统，攻击者须具备本地用户权限及对 /tmp 目录的写入能力，CVSS 评分 6.2，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0722"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:20.643","remediation":"升级 Helix GNOME Updater 至 0.5 以上版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中通过使用安全的临时目录创建方式（如 mktemp -d）修复。如无法升级，可限制 helix-update 命令的执行权限，仅允许 root 用户运行，并避免在多用户环境下使用该工具。同时建议手动删除 /tmp/helix-install 目录（如存在）并监控该路径的异常创建行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0240.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0251.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1593","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=E13QAYl-0007il-00%40the-village.bc.nu","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0722.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0722","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0722.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0722.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gv87-4wrx-xhh7/GHSA-gv87-4wrx-xhh7.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1593/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0722.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--1612d141-a427-439a-9826-3196a4ec8498.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--1612d141-a427-439a-9826-3196a4ec8498.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0874.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0872","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0872.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0718","title":"MandrakeSoft MandrakeUpdate 本地条件竞争漏洞","description":"MandrakeUpdate 存在条件竞争漏洞，本地攻击者可在 RPM 文件暂存于 /tmp 目录期间对其进行恶意修改，导致系统安装被篡改的软件包。该漏洞影响 Mandrake Linux 系统，攻击者需拥有本地访问权限，利用时间窗口替换文件实现权限提升或系统控制。CVSS 评分 1.2，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0718"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:20.137","remediation":"升级 MandrakeUpdate 至修复版本，确保 RPM 包在 /tmp 目录下载完成后使用原子操作移至安全目录再安装，避免竞争窗口期被本地用户篡改。同时启用 RPM 数字签名验证，安装前校验包完整性。如无法升级，可设置更严格的 /tmp 目录权限（如 1777）并监控异常文件修改行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0146.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1567","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0718.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0718","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0718.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af